OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dog on hand as GCSE
OL,4,Astudents open results
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnxious students' nerves were eased by
OL,7,Fa school's therapy dog as they opened
OL,8,Ftheir GCSE results.
OL,10,FMolly the spaniel was on hand at
OL,11,FCockermouth School in Cumbria on the
OL,12,Fday hundreds of thousands of students
OL,13,Facross the country learnt their grades.
OL,15,FSenior deputy headteacher Dr Michelle
OL,16,FHenley said it could be "quite
OL,17,Foverwhelming" getting results "whether
OL,18,Fthey are what you expected, better than
OL,19,Fwhat you expected, different to what
OL,20,Fyou expected".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
