OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dog on hand as GCSE
OL,4,Astudents open results
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's been so many students who've
OL,7,Fcrouched down to give her a little pat
OL,8,For she's gone up to them to give them a
OL,9,Fbit of a cuddle and she just brings a
OL,10,Fsmile."
